OL,3,GNEWSAWill plans for the Ocean Room hit
OL,4,Athe right note?
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevelopers are promising that
OL,7,Fdemolishing and rebuilding a much-loved
OL,8,Fmusic venue will "breathe new life"
OL,9,Finto the resort. But are locals
OL,10,Fconvinced?
OL,12,FPeople gathered at a consultation event
OL,13,Fin Gorleston, Norfolk, to find out more
OL,14,Fabout the plans for the Ocean Room,
OL,15,Fwhich closed in 2024 and has fallen
OL,16,Finto disrepair.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
