OL,3,GNEWSAWill plans for the Ocean Room hit
OL,4,Athe right note?
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreat Yarmouth Borough Council sold the
OL,7,Fderelict building to Bespoke
OL,8,FConstruction. The company wants to
OL,9,Fcreate holiday accommodation, a
OL,10,Fwellness centre and children's play
OL,11,Farea in its place.
OL,13,FSome accept it is time for the
OL,14,F87-year-old landmark to be bulldozed,
OL,15,Fbut not everyone is pleased about the
OL,16,Fambition.
